Package: hyperloom
Type: Package
Title: CTTIR Hyperspectral Imaging Suite
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@charite.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: An installation framework for the CTTIR hyperspectral imaging
    suite. Declares 'hyperspectR', 'hyperspectaculR', 'cuvis.r', and 'tivis.r'
    as required dependencies so that package installers resolve and install
    the suite and its required R dependencies. Provides no analysis functions
    and does not attach the member packages. Instrument software and optional
    backends are configured through the individual packages.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/CTTIR/hyperloom
BugReports: https://github.com/CTTIR/hyperloom/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    hyperspectR,
    hyperspectaculR,
    cuvis.r,
    tivis.r
Remotes:
    CTTIR/hyperspectR,
    CTTIR/hyperspectaculR,
    CTTIR/cuvis.r,
    CTTIR/tivis.r
Additional_repositories: https://cttir.r-universe.dev
